// @check
// @error argument 1: i32 cannot hold the 64-bit constant it meets (the body of `g` computes with it and a constant)
// @error argument 1: i32 cannot hold the 64-bit constant it meets (the body of `h` computes with it and a constant)
// A 64-bit constant beside a type-parameter operand is refused at a pin narrower than it, as
// `(x: i32) + 6442450944` is at its direct spelling; the body alone cannot see the width (D2712).
function g<T>(x: T): T { x + (3 << 31) }
function h<T>(x: T): T { x + 6442450944 }
print(g<i32>(0))
print(h(5))
